{"id": "830aff49f846e880290f", "repository": "Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio", "commit_sha": "a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134", "skill_path": "packages/skills/gate-control/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/blob/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/gate-control/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "6d4163d070bb73ffcfcaf908fc7f3d01ece51eaf", "sha256": "f3ac2cd0e105d54671ad85856672b6fad064d4e0afad87bcc75ec54384293f13", "bytes": 10781, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T11:17:15.187529+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/gate-control/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": ["LICENSE"], "repository_manifest": "manifests/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134.json", "local_package_files": ["packages/skills/gate-control/SKILL.md", "packages/skills/gate-control/references/assembled-productions.md"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: gate-control\ndescription: Canonical VideoStudio review authorization and state-transition policy. Use after any Gate B/C/Preview/D decision, post-gate revision, resumed approval, or exhausted visual-QA result across COMPOSE/AUTO/GENERATE/EDIT; maps explicit user authority and durable artifact state to one next action with `ovs gate transition`. Do not use for ordinary planning or craft decisions before a gate exists.", "declared_name": "gate-control", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
{"id": "69d44c163923f6f5793c", "repository": "Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio", "commit_sha": "a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134", "skill_path": "packages/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/blob/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "cb08a62bb65ed636ede22a464d36a2b160d89324", "sha256": "79226f8b592053a8d11e145797f405be73f02a8dfc1900891edbd4e8c3f6bb04", "bytes": 13572, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T11:17:15.187589+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": ["LICENSE"], "repository_manifest": "manifests/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134.json", "local_package_files": ["packages/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: orchestration\ndescription: The master program for producing or editing a video end to end — read this at the START of any video task (after video-router), then follow the gates and the per-line steps. Trigger for \"make / edit / cut / caption / dub / animate a video\"; it sequences the compose / generate / edit lines and the approval gates. Do NOT trigger for a single low-level operation (just transcribe a file, just probe a clip) — call that operation directly.", "declared_name": "orchestration", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
{"id": "cce8cb9428294bf35d4d", "repository": "Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio", "commit_sha": "a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134", "skill_path": "packages/skills/stage-assemble/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/blob/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/stage-assemble/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "5d25aa99670f18daef369fcc500306818e739bed", "sha256": "b60d16048ea3dcade3c8adc2e30e886e200250b26afb8e65cd45594ec29a5a39", "bytes": 13828, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T11:17:15.187647+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/stage-assemble/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": ["LICENSE"], "repository_manifest": "manifests/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134.json", "local_package_files": ["packages/skills/stage-assemble/SKILL.md"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: stage-assemble\ndescription: Deterministically assemble an approved cross-modal EDL (plan.json) into a finished video — produce each segment (edit/compose/generate/provided, delegated to its line), then assemble in ffmpeg tiers: concat primaries → overlay composed layers → mix narration once (coverage check) → burn captions → verify loudness; idempotent-resumable, with QA before the draft gate. Trigger after a plan is validated and approved; do NOT trigger to ingest or re-author the plan (stage-plan).", "declared_name": "stage-assemble", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
{"id": "c3c66f85f1ee6e418deb", "repository": "Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio", "commit_sha": "a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134", "skill_path": "packages/skills/stage-compose/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/blob/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/stage-compose/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "a7b3a37b3ccedf6a3ffbeac2abbda13f7ab63c5e", "sha256": "ae3dd48cf9d8a259e6c0c0eee46382716758c131fdabebdc547a33362f26e957", "bytes": 17186, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T11:17:15.187706+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/stage-compose/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": ["LICENSE"], "repository_manifest": "manifests/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134.json", "local_package_files": ["packages/skills/stage-compose/SKILL.md", "packages/skills/stage-compose/references/art-direction.md", "packages/skills/stage-compose/references/manifest-and-authoring.md", "packages/skills/stage-compose/references/narration.md", "packages/skills/stage-compose/references/render-and-preview.md", "packages/skills/stage-compose/scripts/composition.mjs"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: stage-compose\ndescription: Authoring knowledge for Orkas/OVS HTML video compositions -- write an index.html, drive animation from a paused timeline, declare canvas + duration, then run the VideoStudio draft gate to render an mp4. Trigger for explainer / animation / motion-graphics / caption / lower-third / title-card work, or to build a compose segment inside an AUTO plan; do NOT trigger for cutting real footage (stage-edit) or AI footage (stage-generate).", "declared_name": "stage-compose", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
{"id": "db4c5675e052b9d1f92c", "repository": "Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio", "commit_sha": "a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134", "skill_path": "packages/skills/stage-consistency/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/blob/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/stage-consistency/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "16afbc148735e04eca765a2e4a96f1879146e550", "sha256": "02fb2cbca405a09a9415ef41926e5219cf069ae86417aa069f8d4fe704f750f9", "bytes": 7132, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T11:17:15.187770+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/stage-consistency/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": ["LICENSE"], "repository_manifest": "manifests/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134.json", "local_package_files": ["packages/skills/stage-consistency/SKILL.md"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: stage-consistency\ndescription: Multi-shot narrative & character consistency — a character bible with a locked front-portrait anchor, view-matched reference selection, recent-frame carry-forward, Cameo (a user photo as the lead), and global planning for long scripts/novels. Trigger on top of the generation line when the SAME character must look the same across many shots/scenes, or for long-form story→video; do NOT trigger for one-off single-shot generation.", "declared_name": "stage-consistency", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
{"id": "5fa604929e94ac14ea56", "repository": "Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio", "commit_sha": "a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134", "skill_path": "packages/skills/stage-decide/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/blob/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/stage-decide/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "bace91a86d557ca79d3c512783f4beeeb7516d84", "sha256": "ccedb0c35008d08e0b4f7b74fdbedadd3bcc710566a7aeb69cec9559e39356ee", "bytes": 5713, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T11:17:15.187829+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/stage-decide/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": ["LICENSE"], "repository_manifest": "manifests/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134.json", "local_package_files": ["packages/skills/stage-decide/SKILL.md"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: stage-decide\ndescription: The decision layer for real footage — understand → select → produce an EVIDENCE-bearing rough cut. Trigger when the EDIT task is \"find / select / reduce / clean\" (remove dead air, drop fillers, pick highlights, cut 1 hour to 3 minutes), NOT executing a known timecode edit (that is stage-edit). Deterministic auto-cuts (silence/filler/quality) are reliable; narrative/emotional selection is a low-confidence DRAFT for the user to review.", "declared_name": "stage-decide", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
{"id": "5df52141bba816f93487", "repository": "Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio", "commit_sha": "a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134", "skill_path": "packages/skills/stage-edit/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/blob/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/stage-edit/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "b7c2e333c410d9c74c67225706623e44f9717c15", "sha256": "fadec141378923bce9b7391c462c32759336e04af33a3e64271cddf34d235a58", "bytes": 10310, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T11:17:15.187879+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/stage-edit/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": ["LICENSE"], "repository_manifest": "manifests/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134.json", "local_package_files": ["packages/skills/stage-edit/SKILL.md", "packages/skills/stage-edit/references/transcript-and-screen-grounded-editing.md"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: stage-edit\ndescription: Intelligent editing of real user-supplied footage—understand it with transcript/inspected-frame/scene/silence/quality evidence, then choose deterministic timeline operations or a constrained semantic AI edit. Trigger for repurpose, montage, cleanup, localization, narration, or local content changes.", "declared_name": "stage-edit", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
{"id": "e031e9ce641d5362ff91", "repository": "Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio", "commit_sha": "a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134", "skill_path": "packages/skills/stage-generate/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/blob/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/stage-generate/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "b317d31745ce481944b85caeaa2ff3fa772b0aa5", "sha256": "1bbd00bd8906c53c13f8da52ff4255c90a6cfda8d32fcbca1cf6421171b42116", "bytes": 6869, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T11:17:15.187938+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/stage-generate/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": ["LICENSE"], "repository_manifest": "manifests/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134.json", "local_package_files": ["packages/skills/stage-generate/SKILL.md"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: stage-generate\ndescription: AI-generated footage plus execution of bounded semantic video-edit segments already approved by EDIT/AUTO. Generate per shot with `ovs video`, preserve signed reference/settings, then assemble. For recurring characters also read stage-consistency.", "declared_name": "stage-generate", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
{"id": "570ad5092898b3e7d13e", "repository": "Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio", "commit_sha": "a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134", "skill_path": "packages/skills/stage-plan/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/blob/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/stage-plan/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "cadacf6aeb1cfad6e20ed97740fcaef76cc6f494", "sha256": "1bda515df1015201fa498bd4e5d5af69037b4d4c3ff8c10b0249d5436ab56908", "bytes": 16503, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T11:17:15.187989+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134/packages/skills/stage-plan/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": ["LICENSE"], "repository_manifest": "manifests/Orkas-AI/Orkas-VideoStudio/a51674eecca7d47fb245c51ed060537d4422b134.json", "local_package_files": ["packages/skills/stage-plan/SKILL.md"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: stage-plan\ndescription: The \"ingest + plan\" half of end-to-end video orchestration — ingest the user's material from evidence, then decompose intent into ONE cross-modal EDL (plan.json: edit/generate/compose/provided segments + narration/music/caption tracks + a delivery promise), validate it with `ovs plan validate`. Trigger when the deliverable spans more than one axis (AUTO line); do NOT trigger for a pure single-axis job (route to that line). The assembler half is stage-assemble.", "declared_name": "stage-plan", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
